# Native driver libraries owned by this module (one -l basename per line;
# blank lines and '#' comments are ignored). zanc discovers this file to bundle
# the driver on --publish; see src/compiler/main.c (zan_discover_drivers).
#
# "<lib> if <symbol-prefix>" = run-time loaded driver: CefBackend dlopens it
# instead of declaring [DllImport], so it never shows up among the linked libs
# and has to be bundled whenever the image actually contains CefBackend's code.
#
# Two variants because CEF's C struct layout is version-bound and the runtime
# branch is picked on the user's machine: zan_cef109 for Windows 7/8/8.1
# (CEF 109 is the last branch supporting them), zan_cef for current stable.
zan_cef if CefBackend_
zan_cef109 if CefBackend_
